STATUS: **stub only, nougat not run**.

## Why this file exists

The 8-artifact standard calls for `extraction/nougat.mmd` alongside `ocr/paper.txt`.
For this LUCID replication dir, only the classical `pdftotext -layout` OCR was
performed (see `../ocr/paper.txt`, 878 lines, sufficient for extracting Table 3
and the numerical claims). Nougat (Meta AI's academic-PDF-to-Markdown neural
OCR) was not run.

## When to fill this in

Trigger a real Nougat run only if any of the following occurs:
- A downstream consumer of this dir needs equation-level MathML/LaTeX from the
  paper (Nougat handles equations; pdftotext does not).
- The `ocr/paper.txt` dump is found to have dropped or garbled tables (Nougat
  preserves table structure much better).
- Re-parsing this paper becomes part of a batch OCR job on uicgpu / Polaris
  (the correct compute for Nougat batches per TOOLS.md OCR allocation rule).

## Command to run (do not run casually)

Nougat is a ~1B parameter vision-encoder-decoder; single-paper CPU time is
~10 min, GPU time ~1 min. Do not run on the OpenClaw workstation fleet.

```bash
# On uicgpu (small batch) or Polaris (large batch):
nougat --model 0.1.0-base --out extraction/ source/paper.pdf
# Output: extraction/paper.mmd
mv extraction/paper.mmd extraction/nougat.mmd
```

